      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{678fd947b51d3c4f77851d07|full_name} Usernames cannot be changed; only display names can be changed. Your username stays the same (the one you use to login), even after you change your display name.\n\nNot sure if this is a bug, or if this should instead be a feature request to change the default instance naming to use display names instead of the username.",
