  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If a user has made instances named with VRC+ (named \"<original_name>'s Instance\") and then changes their display name, it will name it (\"<original_name>'s Instance\") instead of \"<new_name>'s Instance\".\n\nThere should be some sort of detection that the user is using the default VRC+ instance name and adjust it to their display name accordingly.",
